<title>CHINA: FORECAST-China inflation 6.7 percent in 1997.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-China inflation 6.7 percent in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's retail price inflation was forecast to grow by 6.7 percent in 1997 compared with a forecast seven percent this year, the China Market Econonic News said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Retail price inflation rose a year-on-year 6.6 percent in the first nine months of this year, officials figures showed.</p>
<p>Consumer price inflation in 1997 was forecast to rise by 7.9 percent, compared with a forecast 9.5 percent in 1996, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Consumer price inflation rose 8.8 percent in the January-September period this year, official figures showed.</p>
</text>
